---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = '26 October 2026';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of use"
  description="Terms of use for the Sapiogen AI website."
>

  <section class="page-lede">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="sec-index">Terms of use</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Terms of use<span class="dot">.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">
        These terms govern your use of this website. For the terms of a
        client engagement, see your signed statement of work.
      </p>
      <p class="mono last-updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container legal">

      <h2>1. Agreement</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using sapiogenai.com (&ldquo;the Site&rdquo;), you
        agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the
        Site.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Operator</h2>
      <p>
        The Site is operated by Sapiogen AI, based at Yamuna Complex, 5,
        Chimanlal Girdharlal Road, Navrangpura, Ahmedabad, Gujarat 380009,
        India. Contact:
        <a href="mailto:hello@sapiogenai.com" class="link-rule">hello@sapiogenai.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Content on the Site</h2>
      <p>
        Everything on the Site — text, images, code examples, and brand
        marks — is owned by Sapiogen AI or used with permission, and is
        protected by applicable copyright and trademark law. You may read and
        share links to this content; you may not copy, modify, or
        redistribute it without written permission.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Submissions</h2>
      <p>
        Information you submit through the contact or careers forms is
        handled under our
        <a href="/privacy" class="link-rule">Privacy policy</a>. By
        submitting, you confirm the information is accurate and that you have
        the right to share it.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>You agree not to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Attempt to disrupt, overload, or probe the Site for vulnerabilities without written authorisation.</li>
        <li>Scrape content at a volume or rate that affects other visitors.</li>
        <li>Submit false, misleading, or malicious information through our forms.</li>
        <li>Use the Site to send spam or malware.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We may rate-limit, block, or take legal action against activity that
        breaches these rules.
      </p>

      <h2>6. No professional advice</h2>
      <p>
        Content on the Site, including blog posts, is published for general
        information. It is not professional advice. Decisions you make based
        on it are your own.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        The Site links to external websites that we do not control. We are
        not responsible for their content or practices.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Warranty disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        The Site is provided &ldquo;as is&rdquo; and &ldquo;as available&rdquo;,
        without warranties of any kind, express or implied, to the fullest
        extent permitted by law.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, Sapiogen AI will not be
        liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or
        punitive damages arising from your use of the Site.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms. Material changes will be reflected in the
        &ldquo;Last updated&rdquo; date at the top of this page.
      </p>

      <h2>11. Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of India. Disputes are subject
        to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in Ahmedabad, Gujarat.
      </p>

      <h2>12. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms:
        <a href="mailto:hello@sapiogenai.com" class="link-rule">hello@sapiogenai.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .last-updated {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .legal { max-width: 760px; }
  .legal h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .legal h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .legal p { color: var(--text); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem; max-width: 68ch; }
  .legal ul { list-style: none; margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem; display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .legal ul li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .legal ul li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 0.8em;
    width: 8px; height: 1px;
    background: var(--text-dim);
  }
</style>
